---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { EMAIL } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Sovereign data policy"
  description="How your information stays yours: offline work in your building, used only for your plan or finding."
>
  <div class="container section">
    <h1>Sovereign data policy</h1>

    <p>Your information stays yours. This is how we keep it that way, whichever service you choose.</p>
    <p class="intro-actions">
      <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}?subject=First%20conversation`} class="btn btn-primary">Book a conversation</a>
      <a href="#visit" class="btn btn-secondary">How an Epistemic Audit visit works</a>
    </p>

    <h2 id="our-commitments">Our commitments</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Offline, in your building.</strong> Any machine we bring runs in your building, fully offline, sealed from the internet and from your network.</li>
      <li><strong>Used only for your work.</strong> What you show us is used only for your plan or finding, and, on an Epistemic Audit, your signed visit record.</li>
      <li><strong>Your storage, your copy.</strong> Your documents, settings and exports come in on your own USB stick, or are shown to us on your own screen. Your plan or finding goes out on paper or a fresh stick. Your finding belongs to you; your plan is yours to keep.</li>
      <li><strong>Wiped clean in front of you.</strong> On an AI Health Check or an Epistemic Audit, our machine is wiped clean while you watch before we leave.</li>
      <li><strong>Confidential by agreement.</strong> Every engagement is covered by a non-disclosure agreement.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="visit">How an Epistemic Audit visit works</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Start.</strong> We switch on our machine in front of you. It shows its fingerprint on screen, and the same fingerprint is printed on your signed visit record.</li>
      <li><strong>Offline.</strong> The machine is fully offline, sealed from the internet and from your network. We show you.</li>
      <li><strong>Your documents in.</strong> On your own USB stick.</li>
      <li><strong>Your finding, before we leave.</strong> On paper or a fresh stick.</li>
      <li><strong>Wiped clean.</strong> The machine is wiped clean in front of you.</li>
      <li><strong>Signed visit record.</strong> What came in, what went out, who was present, and when the machine was wiped clean. We both sign it.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2 id="by-service">By service</h2>

    <h3><a href="/explore/">AI Exploration</a></h3>
    <p>A conversation and a visit about how your work runs and what AI could do for it. Any machine we bring is fully offline. You keep the written plan.</p>

    <h3><a href="/health-check/">AI Health Check</a></h3>
    <p>You show us your settings, policies, supplier terms and exports in the room. Our machine is fully offline and wiped clean in front of you. Before the visit, please remove passwords, API keys and customer records from any exports.</p>

    <h3><a href="/audits/">Epistemic Audit</a></h3>
    <p>Your documents are loaded from your own storage and come out as a written finding that belongs to you.</p>

    <h2 id="what-we-keep">What we keep</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Your signed Epistemic Audit visit record.</strong> We keep one copy: the date, the number of files and their digital fingerprints, the start and finish times, and the name of the person from your team who was present. It holds the facts of the visit only, with file names and content left out. We keep it for six years as our business record.</li>
      <li><strong>Your first conversation.</strong> Your contact details and what you asked us, kept as set out in our <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="questions">Questions</h2>
    <p>Ask us at <a href="mailto:privacy@cogniosynthesisportal.uk">privacy@cogniosynthesisportal.uk</a>, or in your first conversation. Our full <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a> covers this website and our other services. Registered with the Information Commission (ZC269688).</p>

    <p><a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}?subject=First%20conversation`} class="btn btn-primary">Book a conversation</a></p>
  </div>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  h1 { margin-bottom: var(--spacing-32); }
  h2 { margin-top: var(--spacing-48); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-16); }
  h3 { margin-top: var(--spacing-24); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-12); }
  p, li { margin-bottom: var(--spacing-12); }
  table { margin: var(--spacing-24) 0; font-size: var(--fontsize-body-sm); }
  th, td { vertical-align: top; }
  .intro-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
  hr { margin: var(--spacing-48) 0; border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-default); }
</style>
